UID:EEK8DpIWkV
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nJoe and Angela’s marriage is o
 n thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinn
 er party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited t
 he spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 cinema/in-theaters/the-invite\n\nEstimated start: 16:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Au hasard Balthazar (1966)
DTSTART:20260804T013000Z
DTEND:20260804T032000Z
DTSTAMP:20260804T013000Z
UID:rsbqcn0i11
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club You're the progra
 mmer! You voted for the August 2026 Movie Club selection\, and the winner 
 is... Au Hasard Balthazar!Called Bresson’s “supreme masterpiece\,” A
 u Hasard Balthazar is a poignant religious allegory about the life of a do
 nkey. Baptized by three children\, the donkey’s life and trials become a
  transcendent experience. “Absolutely magnificent… one of the most sig
 nificant events of the cinema\,” —Jean-Luc Godard.To be introduced by 
 SIFF Cinema Worker Adam Plesser.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-even
 ts/siff-movie-club/cinephiles-choice-au-hasard-balthazar\n\nEstimated star
 t: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Michael Mann's Manhunter: The Final Cut (1986)
DTSTART:20260801T194500Z
DTEND:20260801T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260801T194500Z
UID:aVbHmgMSJe
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 119 mins (1h59m)\n\nA new 4K Restoration of Michael 
 Mann’s definitive director’s cut. Will Graham (William Petersen)\, a f
 ormer FBI profiler\, is cajoled out of retirement to help an old colleague
  track down a serial killer called "The Tooth Fairy." The question is: can
  they find the man in time to end his killing spree?\n\nhttps://www.siff.n
 et/cinema/in-theaters/michael-manns-manhunter-the-final-cut\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 13:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
